  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 17th level, if the prime multiple master would be reduced to 0 or fewer hit points by an attack or spell, he may swap places with an active clone, destroying the clone. The prime multiple master still suffers any additional effects, such as stunned or poisoned. This does not trigger any abilities of the clone’s that trigger when it is killed.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/multiple-master#toc26\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
